{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/033",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08230",
   "en": "How are we doing?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08231",
   "en": "Sorry. I forgot about your family situation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08232",
   "en": "Boom goes my promotion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08233",
   "en": "Ask me to clear a bunker of armed hostiles, no problem. Dealing with the foot in my mouth? Not so good with that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08234",
   "en": "Yeah. Military families, eh? With schedules like that, it's a wonder we ever have kids any more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08235",
   "en": "He was real proud when I made Chief. First thing he did was salute.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08236",
   "en": "You must know what military wives are like. Strong because they have to be. Able to raise kids while Dad's away on a six-month cruise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08237",
   "en": "She has a degree in planetary geology. She and Dad both wanted to see new worlds.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08238",
   "en": "She gave up her career to raise us, though.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08239",
   "en": "All over. Same as you, I expect.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08240",
   "en": "All over.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08241",
   "en": "We transferred a half-dozen times before I finished grade school. You go where Personnel Command sends you, right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08242",
   "en": "I guess that's why I'm so tight with my sisters. We'd have to leave all our friends every two or three years.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08243",
   "en": "Don't knock show tunes, sir. I might have to take exception.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08244",
   "en": "Things were tense between Sarah and me for a while. Then we... bonded.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08245",
   "en": "Dad always wanted to serve in space. But he wanted us to have real ground under our feet. He'd say, \"Space is beautiful, but you can't raise a family there.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08246",
   "en": "\"I cannot rest from travel: I will drink life to the lees. All times I have enjoy'd greatly, have suffer'd greatly, both with those that loved me, and alone.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08247",
   "en": "\"For always roaming with a hungry heart. Much have I seen and known. Cities of men, and manners, climates, councils, governments...\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08248",
   "en": "Just because I can drill you between the eyes at a hundred meters doesn't mean I can't like sensitive stuff.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08249",
   "en": "Just don't spread it around.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08250",
   "en": "Not everyone can bust up a slaver ring on their first tour, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08251",
   "en": "Not everyone goes through the crap you had to, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08252",
   "en": "Not everyone can win the Star of Terra, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08253",
   "en": "Some of us just live ordinary lives.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08254",
   "en": "Doubt it'll work on geth, sir, but I'll give it a shot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08255",
   "en": "Just like to remember why we fight.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08256",
   "en": "\"Ulysses\" was Dad's favorite poem. Every time he shipped out, he recorded me reading it. He had a dozen versions when he retired.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08257",
   "en": "He also brewed his own beer and played a mean baritone sax.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08258",
   "en": "I sure hope so. I read it to his grave every time I go home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08259",
   "en": "Dad passed on a few years back. He's probably still watching, though. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08260",
   "en": "So behave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08261",
   "en": "Dead on, skipper. He's with God now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08262",
   "en": "You know. From heaven. Wherever that is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08263",
   "en": "That's not a problem with you, is it? That I believe in God?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08264",
   "en": "I'm glad you're open-minded about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08265",
   "en": "Yeah. Guess you have.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08266",
   "en": "I've met a few people who were really weirded out by my faith. Because I work in space, I can't believe in a higher power? Geez.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08267",
   "en": "Hello? Have you people looked out the window? How can you look at this galaxy and not believe in something?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08268",
   "en": "Commander, I'm not some kind of zealot. I believe in God. What everyone else believes is their business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08269",
   "en": "Just my commanding officer, huh? We'll have to see about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08270",
   "en": "You should.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08271",
   "en": "Mm. Too bad.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08272",
   "en": "Me? I'm not saying anything, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08273",
   "en": "I appreciate that, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08274",
   "en": "I should double-check my gear before we move out. Those krogan aren't going to kill themselves.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08275",
   "en": "I should get back to my duties. Didn't mean to take up so much of your time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08276",
   "en": "You're lucky to have a close family.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08277",
   "en": "I'll be sure to mention your tact in your next performance review.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08278",
   "en": "Or lack thereof. Relax, Williams. I've dealt with it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08279",
   "en": "I was an only child, but I get the idea. At least one of my parents was always on duty.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08280",
   "en": "What about your mother? You haven't mentioned her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08281",
   "en": "Where did you grow up?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08282",
   "en": "Next you'll tell me you all ran across green fields, singing show tunes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08283",
   "en": "After helping raise them, your sisters still talk to you? Amazing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08284",
   "en": "Sounds like your father wasn't around much. Wasn't your family stationed near him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08285",
   "en": "I never thought I'd hear you reciting poetry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08286",
   "en": "Is the rest of your life story this dull?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08287",
   "en": "Poetry? You going to bore the enemy to death, marine?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08288",
   "en": "I didn't know you liked classical literature.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08289",
   "en": "He must have been a very boring man.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08290",
   "en": "Does he still like it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08291",
   "en": "You mean from wherever we go after death.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08292",
   "en": "He's not a zombie, is he?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08293",
   "en": "I thought you said he was dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08294",
   "en": "Everyone has the right to believe what they want. Says so in the Alliance charter. Only with fancier words.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08295",
   "en": "You know that old saw, \"there's never an atheist in a foxhole?\" I've been in a lot of foxholes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08296",
   "en": "You start preaching in the CIC, we'll have a problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08297",
   "en": "Your beliefs are your business. I'm your commanding officer, not your moral compass.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08298",
   "en": "I'll look forward to our next talk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08299",
   "en": "We're on duty here, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08300",
   "en": "What are you saying, Williams?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08301",
   "en": "Must be nice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08302",
   "en": "Sounds familiar.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08303",
   "en": "Mom",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08305",
   "en": "Yes, charming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08306",
   "en": "You raised your sisters?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08307",
   "en": "Yeah, tactful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08308",
   "en": "Your dad was gone a lot?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08309",
   "en": "I've always liked that one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08310",
   "en": "You read poetry?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08311",
   "en": "Bored now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08312",
   "en": "What's this crap?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08313",
   "en": "Tennyson, right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08314",
   "en": "It's a good piece.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08315",
   "en": "Sounds dull.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08316",
   "en": "Really?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08317",
   "en": "From the afterlife?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08318",
   "en": "Yeah, sure he is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08319",
   "en": "Watching?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08320",
   "en": "I do too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08321",
   "en": "Not my place to judge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08322",
   "en": "We will.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08323",
   "en": "Keep it professional.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08324",
   "en": "Oh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08325",
   "en": "Hey, skipper. Figured you'd be busy with tactical briefings and whatnot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08326",
   "en": "Don't know what I think about us attacking today, of all days. Kind of an ill omen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08327",
   "en": "Hey, skipper. Any interest in a small drink? It's a special occasion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08328",
   "en": "You're always on duty, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08329",
   "en": "I only have enough to toast the day, not the captain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08330",
   "en": "All right. But you know, a 'still is the first thing the engineers install after engines.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08331",
   "en": "It's Armistice Day. When the First Contact War ended. My family always marks it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08332",
   "en": "Since I'm the only Williams aboard, I thought I'd ask you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08333",
   "en": "Maybe not. Maybe I'd rather share this with you. You ever consider that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08334",
   "en": "In our family, it's not really a celebration. More like an obligation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08335",
   "en": "Don't tell me you don't know about my family. My commanders always find out. It's not in my files or something?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08336",
   "en": "There's a reason for the crap assignments.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08337",
   "en": "I don't always play games, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08338",
   "en": "I'm General Williams' granddaughter. The commander of the Shanxi garrison in the War.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08339",
   "en": "\"The only human ever to surrender to an alien race.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08340",
   "en": "\"A Williams has to be better than the best, if only to avoid suspicion.\" That's what my Dad told me the night before he retired.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08341",
   "en": "Cowardice. That's what the Terra Firma Party calls it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08342",
   "en": "Not formally. Dad got passed for promotion over and over. And I think my record merits more than garrison duty on a backwater agri colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08343",
   "en": "It takes a special kind of thickheaded to march into a job where your family's blacklisted. I did it anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08344",
   "en": "I'm not going to let our name go down with Arnold and Quisling. Granddad deserved better than that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08345",
   "en": "The turians wrecked the orbitals in the first wave, and occupied the major cities. They sat in orbit, dropping rocks on anything that moved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08346",
   "en": "Granddad dispersed the troops. But when they went into the cities for supplies, the turians would wreck a block to eliminate one fire team.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08347",
   "en": "Civilians were dying. His troops were starving. And he couldn't contact Alliance High Command. So he surrendered the garrison.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08348",
   "en": "I'm on duty. Have anything without alcohol?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08349",
   "en": "What's the occasion?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08350",
   "en": "With all we've been through lately? Hell yes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08351",
   "en": "Last I checked, the Alliance Navy was dry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08352",
   "en": "You can't think I'm the most patriotic person on the ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08353",
   "en": "Seems like an odd thing to celebrate. That was 26 years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08354",
   "en": "There's almost nothing in your files. Technical scores and a list of crap assignments.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08355",
   "en": "Are you playing games with me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08356",
   "en": "I see. That's why you drive yourself so hard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08357",
   "en": "You're blacklisted because of your grandfather's cowardice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08358",
   "en": "Don't tell me you're blamed for that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08359",
   "en": "As I recall, your grandfather held out for a long time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08360",
   "en": "Non-alcoholic.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08361",
   "en": "Occasion",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08362",
   "en": "Sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08363",
   "en": "That's contraband.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08364",
   "en": "I'm flattered.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08365",
   "en": "Why celebrate?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08366",
   "en": "Your files are clean.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08367",
   "en": "Now I understand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08368",
   "en": "Not your fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08370",
   "en": "Would it make a difference? He's gone now. Dad's gone, too. And who would it impress? I'll never be good enough for the Alliance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08371",
   "en": "Look at who I am, Shepard. Do you ever hear me ask for help?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08372",
   "en": "It's not that bad things don't happen to me. If you stay with me long enough, maybe I'll tell you about some of them. But I deal with them myself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08373",
   "en": "I don't need a shoulder to cry on, a knight to rescue me, or a man to make me happy. This is who I am. I like her. And you better like her, too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08374",
   "en": "He was relieved of command as soon as Shanxi was liberated. They brought him back to Earth in irons, but there was never a trial.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08375",
   "en": "They quietly demoted him, and stuck him behind a desk. He retired a year later, and spent the rest of his life working construction in the colonies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08376",
   "en": "Sometimes we hear about attempts to get him exonerated in some official way. Nothing ever comes of them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08377",
   "en": "No, sir. I'd die to stop him, if that's what it takes.",
